,"commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2022-08-31T18:20:43Z","label":{"name":"kind/bug","color":"c2e0c6"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":7298695382,"node_id":"LE_lADOBlCVUc5Q7MuazwAAAAGzCUDW","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/7298695382","actor":{"login":"yugabyte-ci","id":17281578,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjgxNTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17281578?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte-ci","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2022-08-31T18:20:43Z","label":{"name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1233269894","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/13826#issuecomment-1233269894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/13826","id":1233269894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc5JgjSG","user":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-31T18:22:27Z","updated_at":"2022-08-31T18:22:27Z","body":"Post-split compaction could be triggered and started before `TabletPeer` is fully initialized, in this case before `TabletPeer::tablet_` is set. But during compaction `Tablet::DeleteMarkerRetentionTime` could be called by compaction context.\r\n\r\nIn its turn `Tablet::DeleteMarkerRetentionTime` can result to following calls:\r\n```\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/running_transaction.cc:219:                                                         @     0x7fc6a718625a  yb::tablet::RunningTransaction::SendStatusRequest(long, shared_ptr<yb::tablet::RunningTransaction> const&)\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/running_transaction.cc:132:                                                         @     0x7fc6a7185ccf  yb::tablet::RunningTransaction::RequestStatusAt(yb::StatusRequest const&, std::unique_lock<std::mutex>*)\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/transaction_participant.cc:792:                                                     @     0x7fc6a72f89e3  yb::tablet::TransactionParticipant::Impl::MinRunningHybridTime()\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/transaction_participant.cc:1769:                                                    @     0x7fc6a72f1250  yb::tablet::TransactionParticipant::MinRunningHybridTime() const\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/tablet.cc:3863:                                                                     @     0x7fc6a71c85b5  yb::tablet::Tablet::DeleteMarkerRetentionTime(std::vector<rocksdb::FileMetaData*, std::allocator<rocksdb::FileMetaData*> > const&)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhere `RunningTransaction::context_.participant_context_` is actually a reference to `TabletPeer` (which is not yet fully initialized and `TabletPeer::tablet_` is not set).\r\nSo on `RunningTransaction::SendStatusRequest` sends an RPC to get transaction status and a result of this call `RunningTransaction::StatusReceived` is called which results in following calls:\r\n```\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/tablet_peer.cc:711:                                                                 @     0x7f8a7306ba27  yb::tablet::TabletPeer::SafeTimeForTransactionParticipant()\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/tablet_peer.cc:0:                                                                   @     0x7f8a7306bbc8  non-virtual thunk to yb::tablet::TabletPeer::SafeTimeForTransactionParticipant()\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/transaction_participant.cc:1166:                                                    @     0x7f8a730e40a5  yb::tablet::TransactionParticipant::Impl::ProcessRemoveQueueUnlocked(yb::tablet::MinRunningNotifier*)\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/transaction_participant.cc:1145:                                                    @     0x7f8a730ddedc  yb::tablet::TransactionParticipant::Impl::EnqueueRemoveUnlocked(yb::StronglyTypedUuid<yb::TransactionId_Tag> const&, yb::tablet::RemoveReason, yb::tablet::MinRunningNotifier*)\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/running_transaction.cc:345:                                                         @     0x7f8a72f6ae8c  yb::tablet::RunningTransaction::DoStatusReceived(yb::Status const&, yb::tserver::GetTransactionStatusResponsePB const&, long, shared_ptr<yb::tablet::RunningTransaction> const&)\r\n../../src/yb/tablet/running_transaction.cc:247:                                                         @     0x7f8a72f69c28  yb::tablet::RunningTransaction::StatusReceived(yb::Status const&, yb::tserver::GetTransactionStatusResponsePB const&, long, shared_ptr<yb::tablet::RunningTransaction> const&)\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd we then have a crash there, because `tablet_ == nullptr` :\r\n```\r\nHybridTime TabletPeer::SafeTimeForTransactionParticipant() {\r\n  return tablet_->mvcc_manager()->SafeTimeForFollower(\r\n      /* min_allowed= */ HybridTime::kMin, /* deadline= */ CoarseTimePoint::min());\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1233269894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":7298710634,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOBlCVUc5Q7MuazwAAAAGzCXxq","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/7298710634","actor":{"login":"yugabyte-ci","id":17281578,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjgxNTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17281578?v=4